exclusions:
  panel-datasource-rule:
    reason: >-
      Datasource UIDs are pinned on purpose (admin-prod-obs-amw, where the
      blackbox probes and the altinn:probe_success_* recording rules live). A
      ${datasource} variable saves the value "default"; the default datasource
      in dis-grafana-prod is Azure Monitor rather than Prometheus, so Grafana
      silently falls back to the first Prometheus datasource -- a dis-core AMW
      that holds no probe data -- and the panels render empty with no error.
      See CLAUDE.md.
    entries:
      - dashboard: Status UP
      - dashboard: SLA - Service Owners
      - dashboard: SLA - Altinn Product
      - dashboard: Endpoint Statistics
  template-datasource-rule:
    reason: >-
      No datasource template variable by design; see panel-datasource-rule.
    entries:
      - dashboard: Status UP
      - dashboard: SLA - Service Owners
      - dashboard: SLA - Altinn Product
      - dashboard: Endpoint Statistics
